# CAMBER on its third track, GLACIER, at the game's own defaults (RATE
# 60 FPS, class BRISK, mode RACE). Run with --boot off --fps 60
# --frames 1441.
#
# Home screen: one step right to the CAMBER tile; A (south) at 110 opens
# the game. DOWN (200) to TRACK, RIGHT twice (230, 260) from LAGOON
# through FURNACE to GLACIER, UP (300) back to PLAY. A on PLAY (330)
# starts the race and stays held from here on as the throttle; GO! shows
# at about 510.
90 press right
91 release right
110 press south
111 release south
200 press down
201 release down
230 press right
231 release right
260 press right
261 release right
300 press up
301 release up
330 press south
# From 500 the ship drives itself by these lines: every 4 pictures the
# stick points at the middle of the road seen on two rows, and B (east),
# the air brake, is pulled when the road runs far off to one side. A
# closed-loop helper wrote these lines by looking at each picture; they
# are plain inputs and replay the same race every time.
# About 800 to 960: the ship catches the pack and moves up among the
# rivals. About 1288: a boost pad; about 1330 to 1348 the ship flies
# over the jump's gap beside the rivals and lands in 6th place.
500 stick left -2000 0
512 stick left 16000 0
512 press east
524 release east
544 press east
